{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 总纲MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"RAG 技术 MOC\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> moc\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"RAG技术\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> meta/moc\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/RAG\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/检索增强</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E6%80%BB%E7%BA%B2MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E6%80%BB%E7%BA%B2MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">总纲MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"RAG 技术 MOC\" dir=\"auto\">RAG 技术 MOC</h1>\n<blockquote dir=\"auto\">\n<p>RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) 是 Agent 获取外部知识的核心技术，涵盖向量数据库、检索策略、重排序、GraphRAG 等。共 <strong>18 题</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 核心概念\" dir=\"auto\">1. 核心概念</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Naive RAG</strong> — 基础检索+生成流程</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Advanced RAG</strong> — 查询改写、重排序、混合检索</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Modular RAG</strong> — 模块化、可编排的 RAG 系统</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>GraphRAG</strong> — 基于知识图谱的全局推理 RAG</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 面试题集\" dir=\"auto\">2. 面试题集</h2>\n<h3 data-heading=\"2.1. 基础 (Fundamental)\" dir=\"auto\">2.1. 基础 (Fundamental)</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编号</th>\n<th>题目</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Q01</td>\n<td>RAG 基本原理</td>\n<td>Retrieve → Augment → Generate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q02</td>\n<td>向量数据库选型</td>\n<td>Milvus/Pinecone/Chroma/Qdrant 对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q03</td>\n<td>Embedding 模型选择</td>\n<td>语义相似度与业务适配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q04</td>\n<td>文本分块策略</td>\n<td>Chunking 策略与粒度控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q05</td>\n<td>相似度度量方法</td>\n<td>Cosine/Euclidean/Dot Product</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"2.2. 中级 (Intermediate)\" dir=\"auto\">2.2. 中级 (Intermediate)</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编号</th>\n<th>题目</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Q06</td>\n<td>查询改写与扩展</td>\n<td>Query Transformation/HyDE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q07</td>\n<td>混合检索策略</td>\n<td>向量检索 + 关键词检索融合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q08</td>\n<td>重排序 (Rerank)</td>\n<td>Cross-Encoder 与 Reranker 模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q09</td>\n<td>上下文压缩</td>\n<td>Context Compression/Map-Reduce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q10</td>\n<td>多路召回与融合</td>\n<td>Multi-Recall + RRF 融合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q11</td>\n<td>RAG 评估指标</td>\n<td>HitRate/MRR/NDCG/Recall@K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q12</td>\n<td>增量索引与更新</td>\n<td>实时更新与版本管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"2.3. 高级 (Advanced)\" dir=\"auto\">2.3. 高级 (Advanced)</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编号</th>\n<th>题目</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Q13</td>\n<td>GraphRAG 原理与实现</td>\n<td>知识图谱 + RAG 的全局推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q14</td>\n<td>Agentic RAG</td>\n<td>Agent 驱动的主动检索策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q15</td>\n<td>RAG 与 Fine-tuning 结合</td>\n<td>RAG + FT 的混合方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q16</td>\n<td>多模态 RAG</td>\n<td>图文音视频多模态检索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q17</td>\n<td>生产级 RAG 架构</td>\n<td>高可用、可扩展的 RAG 系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Q18</td>\n<td>RAG 成本优化</td>\n<td>检索效率与 Token 成本控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. RAG 演进路线\" dir=\"auto\">3. RAG 演进路线</h2>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">Naive RAG → Advanced RAG → Modular RAG → Agentic RAG → GraphRAG\n 基础检索    查询改写/重排    模块化编排     Agent主动检索    图谱全局推理\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 关键技术对比\" dir=\"auto\">4. 关键技术对比</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Naive RAG</td>\n<td>简单快速</td>\n<td>精度有限</td>\n<td>原型验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Advanced RAG</td>\n<td>精度提升</td>\n<td>复杂度增加</td>\n<td>生产环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GraphRAG</td>\n<td>全局推理</td>\n<td>构建成本高</td>\n<td>复杂知识库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Agentic RAG</td>\n<td>主动检索</td>\n<td>延迟较高</td>\n<td>开放域问答</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"5. 核心组件选型\" dir=\"auto\">5. 核心组件选型</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>主流选择</th>\n<th>关键考量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>向量数据库</td>\n<td>Milvus, Pinecone, Chroma</td>\n<td>规模、延迟、成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Embedding</td>\n<td>text-embedding-3, BGE, GTE</td>\n<td>语种、维度、精度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reranker</td>\n<td>Cohere Rerank, bge-reranker</td>\n<td>精度 vs 延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分块策略</td>\n<td>Recursive, Semantic, Agentic</td>\n<td>内容类型、粒度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"6. 相关 MOC\" dir=\"auto\">6. 相关 MOC</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/LLM%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">LLM基础MOC</a> — Embedding、Transformer 基础</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工具调用与MCP MOC</a> — 检索作为工具</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工程实践MOC</a> — RAG 系统的生产部署</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a> — LangChain/LlamaIndex RAG 实现</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}